  // listener below) - shown to every player in the room as an automatic
  // popup, no confirm/blockchain step needed since no money is involved.
  // [FREE PLAY - MATCH LIMIT] matchLimit/matchesPlayed now live on
  // roomInfo itself (see freeRoomProgress listener) - the "all matches
